# 🎮 Video Game Sales Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project analyzes global video game sales using Tableau. It provides interactive visualizations to help identify sales trends, top-performing games, publishers, platforms, and regional market performance.

## Dashboard Preview

![Video Game Sales Dashboard](dashboard.png)

## Objectives

- Analyze video game sales across North America, Europe, Japan, and Other Regions.
- Identify top-selling games, genres, and publishers.
- Create an interactive dashboard for business insights.

## Tools & Technologies

- Tableau Desktop
- Microsoft Excel
- Kaggle Dataset

## Dashboard Features

- Global Sales Overview
- Regional Sales Analysis
- Top 10 Best-Selling Games
- Genre-wise Sales Analysis
- Publisher Performance
- Interactive Filters

## Key Skills Demonstrated

- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization
- Business Intelligence
- Dashboard Design
- Tableau

## Outcome

The dashboard enables users to explore sales performance across different regions and identify market trends through interactive visualizations.

